<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ASR AL-SHAMS - Solar Energy</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0a0b10;
            --card-bg: #1c1c24;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --accent-orange: #f59e0b; /* Amber/Orange */
            --accent-green: #22c55e;
            --font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-family);
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden; /* Prevent horizontal scroll */
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        /* Mobile Container Simulation (390px) */
        .mobile-container {
            width: 390px;
            max-width: 100%;
            position: relative;
            background: var(--bg-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24, #d97706);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
        }

        .brand-text {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .brand-name {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .brand-sub {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .menu-btn {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .menu-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .menu-line {
            width: 16px;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        /* Main Content */
        main {
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .breadcrumb {
            color: var(--accent-orange);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: var(--accent-orange);
        }

        p.description {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            text-align: right;
        }

        /* Card Component */
        .product-card {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #b45309 0%, #451a03 100%);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 24px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.25);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        /* Decorative Grid Background in Card */
        .card-bg-grid {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 50px);
            grid-template-rows: repeat(3, 60px);
            gap: 10px;
            opacity: 0.15;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .grid-cell {
            background: black;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        /* Card Header Area */
        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .power-badge {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .lightning-icon {
            color: var(--accent-orange);
        }

        .tag-badge {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
        }

        /* Card Body */
        .card-body {
            z-index: 1;
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        .location-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .location-icon {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .card-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .price-section {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }

        .price-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .price-value {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--accent-orange); /* Or lighter orange/white depending on exact screenshot match */
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        /* Floating Action Button */
        .fab {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 20px; /* RTL context usually puts it on the visual start, but screenshot shows left side for 'N' icon? 
                           Wait, the screenshot has the green button on the bottom LEFT. 
                           In RTL, 'left' is visually the end. 
                           The button contains an 'N' which might be a notification or navigation icon.
                           I will place it absolute to container to simulate fixed within viewport. */
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            background-color: #15803d; /* Darker Green */
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4);
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 100;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
        }

        .fab-inner {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            background-color: var(--accent-green);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #064e3b;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 20px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="mobile-container">

        <!-- Navigation -->
        <header>
            <div class="menu-btn" aria-label="Menu">
                <span class="menu-line"></span>
                <span class="menu-line"></span>
                <span class="menu-line"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="logo-area">
                <div class="brand-text">
                    <div class="brand-name">عصر الشمس</div>
                    <div class="brand-sub">ASR AL-SHAMS</div>
                </div>
                <div class="logo-icon">
                    ☀️
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Content -->
        <main>
            <div class="breadcrumb">الرئيسية</div>

            <h1>مشروعو<span>ن لتنتقاذ الطاقة</span><br>في الربيع</h1>

            <p class="description">
                مشروع تزويد أراضي ريف اليرموك ونوس وسط بقطعة كهرباء – مشروع منتجي طاقة شمسية عبر نظام زراعة طاقة المتجددة للمنشآت الصناعية
            </p>

            <!-- Product Card -->
            <article class="product-card">
                <!-- Decorative BG -->
                <div class="card-bg-grid">
                    <div class="grid-cell"></div><div class="grid-cell"></div><div class="grid-cell"></div>
                    <div class="grid-cell"></div><div class="grid-cell"></div><div class="grid-cell"></div>
                    <div class="grid-cell"></div><div class="grid-cell"></div><div class="grid-cell"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Top Row -->
                <div class="card-header">
                    <div class="tag-badge">محطة PV-Diesel</div>
                    <div class="power-badge">
                        <span class="lightning-icon">⚡</span>
                        <span>409.2 كيلووات</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Text Content -->
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="location-row">
                        <span class="location-icon">📍</span>
                        <span>سوريا</span>
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="card-title">مشروعو محطة الربيع</h2>

                    <p class="card-desc">
                        تقع هذه المنشأة Diesel-PV (بقدرة 409.2 كيلووات) باستخدام الوحدات الزمنية Solar AE تستخدم فيها قيم معدل استهلاك الوقود اليومي للمنشأة المطلوبة
                    </p>

                    <div class="price-section">
                        <span class="price-label">كيلووات</span>
                        <span class="price-value">409.2</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </main>

        <!-- Floating Button -->
        <div class="fab" title="Notification">
            <div class="fab-inner">N</div>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
